	Beyond Games is seeking to expand its cutting-edge programming crew to
tackle some very exciting projects.  Our team is made up of dedicated
game players, and our employees enjoy a cool working environment,
significant creative control over their work, and a stake in the
profits of the company.
	If you are adept with C++ and below and are dedicated to pushing the
envelope of game programming, we'd like to hear from you.  Corporate
or collegiate experience is less important to us than programming
talent and dedication, so please don't hesitate to submit a resume
because you haven't worked in the game industry before.
	Note: we are not currently hiring artists, designers, producers, etc.
Promgrammers, please submit your resume to the mailing address below.
You are welcome--even encouraged--to submit examples of your work;
they will be kept confidential, but we cannot guarantee their safety
or return.

